+# Human-eye pass: F-12 CORS attribution corrected — the customer gateway's allow-list source is gateway/service/app.py, not the already-fixed core app_builder
+
+- **Agent**: human-eye (Job 478344, 06:50+08 dispatch cycle, probes at 2026-10-29 23:0xZ)
+- **Companion reports**: human-eye-auth-api-broken-20261029.md (#2258 cycle-22 F-12 — the finding this pass independently re-confirms and re-attributes), #2299 addendum (chat-surface extension)
+- **Method**: anonymous zero-credential probes (no app origin needed — the server's own preflight failure response carries the allow-list metadata), plus in-repo config archaeology on live main ebe630c
